---
layout: layouts/auth.njk
title: Lupa Kata Sandi
---
<div class="text-center mb-4">
  <div class="text-primary mb-2 display-6">{% icon "key" %}</div>
  <h4 class="fw-bold">Lupa Kata Sandi?</h4>
  <p class="text-muted small">Masukkan email Anda dan kami akan mengirimkan instruksi riset password.</p>
</div>

<form action="/auth/reset-password/" method="get">
  <div class="mb-3">
    <label class="form-label">Alamat Email Registered</label>
    <input type="email" class="form-control" placeholder="nama@domain.com" required>
  </div>
  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary w-100 py-2">Kirim Link Riset</button>
</form>

<div class="text-center mt-4">
  <a href="/auth/login/" class="small text-decoration-none">{% icon "arrow-left" %} Kembali ke Login</a>
</div>
